 n\nDiscover the art of watercolor in an intimate workshop with de Gournay\
 , the esteemed London-based atelier celebrated for its hand-painted wallpa
 pers and dedication to centuries-old decorative techniques. Founded on a r
 everence for tradition and craftsmanship\, de Gournay has become synonymou
