SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Rethinking Women's Health - Look Good\, Feel Good
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Health & Wellness\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only
 \nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180901\n\n5:00PM Rece
 ption\, 5:30PM Discussion \nAn exploration of vitality\, strength\, and w
 ellbeing\, this thoughtfully curated conversation - moderated by Jay Lutha
 r MD\, Founder and Medical Director of Lutanen Health & Faculty at Harvard
  Medical School - brings together leading voices in women’s health for a
  discussion designed to inform\, inspire\, and empower.\n\nTogether\, Meli
 ssa Hines\, Founder of Wellest Integrative Health\, Kathy Kates\, Family N
 urse Practitioner\, and Izzy Antonelli\, Exercise Physiologist & Strength 
 and Conditioning Specialist\, will guide a dynamic discussion spanning sex
 ual health\, hormonal care\, movement\, metabolism\, bone health\, and lon
 gevity. With perspectives grounded in pelvic health\, clinical expertise\,
  and exercise physiology\, the conversation offers a holistic view of how 
 we support and sustain the body through every stage of life.\n\nThe dialog
 ue invites a deeper understanding of how these interconnected elements sha
 pe not only how we feel day to day\, but how we move\, age\, and thrive ov
 er time—bringing clarity\, nuance\, and actionable insight to essential 
 aspects of women’s health.\n\nThoughtful\, engaging\, and rooted in expe
 rtise\, this program offers members an opportunity to reconnect with their
  bodies and approach wellbeing with intention and confidence.\n\n*This eve
 nt is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bit
 es will be served\, and beverages will be available for purchase.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180901
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
END:VEVENT
