SUMMARY:Ride With The 'Quin: Pan Mass Challenge Registration
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: 
 Available\nTime: 6 AM – 8 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.co
 m/events/175753\n\nOn August 1 & 2\, 2026\, the Pan-Mass Challenge returns
  to Massachusetts\, uniting riders to raise funds for cancer research and 
 treatment at Dana-Farber Cancer Institute. \n\nMembers who participate wi
 th Team ’Quin will receive financial support from The ’Quin Impact Fun
 d\, which is allocating $25\,000 to be shared among riders. Individual spo
 nsorship amounts will be determined based on the final number of participa
 nts.\n\nWe’re proud to continue our partnership with the Patriots Plate
 let Pedalers (PPP) Team. This year\, riders will register exclusively wi
 th PPP to be eligible for Impact Fund support. Registration instructions w
 ill be shared following form completion. \n\nInterested in riding this ye
 ar? Click here. Registration closes on April 15th\, 2026. \n\nPlease reac
 h out to The 'Quin Impact Fund team at impact@thequin.com  with any ques
 tions or concerns.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/175753
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
